# Trivy IaC scan — accepted risks
#
# Each entry suppresses a specific finding. Remove an entry only when the
# underlying issue has been addressed in the Terraform code.

# AVD-AZU-0047: Network security group allows inbound from the internet.
#
# Intentional: the NSG on snet-aci allows port 8081 from nsg_inbound_source
# (default "*"). This is by design for internet-accessible public deployments
# where Nexus is the pip index for external users. For private deployments set
# vnet_integrated = true and nsg_inbound_source = "<your-corporate-CIDR>" in
# terraform.tfvars — the NSG rule will then only allow your network.
AVD-AZU-0047
